# ── Changelog Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional: GitHub Personal Access Token for changelog generation.
# Enables PR metadata resolution via the GitHub API.
# Without it, the script still works — it just won't resolve PR links.
#
# Generate at: https://github.com/settings/tokens (scope: public_repo)
# In GitHub Actions, GITHUB_TOKEN is automatically available.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
